- Receptacles

- Some windows (bedroom window facing parking is broken. Exterior pane cracked)

- Furnace (combustion supply)

- Electric entry very leaky 



During the infiltration test walkthrough, we notice air leakage on the items listed above. Airtightness is the key for energy saving.

</airSeal>
